0..78 Comment "//! A flow between data types given by a translator, after directed univalence"
79..150 Comment "//! [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory],"
151..230 Comment "//! Definition 1.2: a data type is covered as the sum of its constructors, each"
231..308 Comment "//! the product of its fields, so a translator that only moves fields between"
309..386 Comment "//! constructors gives a flow, and riding it moves a value of the old type to"
387..399 Comment "//! the new."
400..403 Comment "//!"
404..483 Comment "//! - cites: [Gratzer-2026-directed_univalence_simplicial_homotopy_type_theory]"
484..487 Comment "//!"
